vel)\n- `scripts/eng/v2/contract/pr-key.mjs` validates the **raw** GraphQL answer before projecting anything:\n  - exactly the nine `PrSnapshotKey` fields, `isDraft` included;\n  - the live base tip (`baseRef.target.oid`), never the recorded `base.sha`;\n  - `malformed` or `read_failed` for anything else, with no default branch.\n- `scripts/eng/v2/adapter/internal/coherence.mjs` brackets each pass with K0 and K1:\n  - one retry, then `pr_key_moved`; failures are never retried;\n  - a terminal pass reads only the key;\n  - exceptions fail closed;\n  - the confirming pass runs once and separates `pr_key_moved` from `unstable_snapshot`.\n- `scripts/eng/v2/contract/reasons.mjs` is the V1 closed reason set, with the reason-precedence rule that resolves #800 P2 `4211046602` in the implementation.\n- `scripts/eng/v2/README.md` lists the V1 rules that differ from the merged records.\n\n### Tests-first\n`npx vitest run tests/eng/v2`: 30 tests (16 coherence, 14 key), alongside the 34 existing CP-005a tests, which are unchanged.\n- Real fixtures: #800 (open, draft), #809 (merged), #776 (open on a non-production base), #623 (closed, unmerged).\n- Spec-derived single-point mutations, each carrying its required outcome.\n- 3,000 seeded fuzz cases.\n- Harness teeth: the CP-005a-style coercing projection and a forgets-`isDraft` mutant are both detected.\n\n### Remaining\n- Rows 2–6: drift, applicable CI, review provenance, review threads, completeness.\n- The independent verification lane.\n- Live collection, which needs the dedicated read-only credential.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n","created_at":"2026-10-07T20:16:40Z","updated_at":"2026-10-07T20:19:23Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"089271a1187cf71eff8d8d2d4879bb43efef8b28","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":true,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SaiSamyukthVemuri/Hone/pulls/810/commits","review